---
source: tests/golden/notifications.rs
expression: "norm::text(&out)"
---
provider: nextcloudtalk (Nextcloud Talk)

## minimal config
{
  "bot_secret": "secret-bot_secret",
  "conversation_token": "abcd1234",
  "host": "https://cloud.example.com",
  "silent_up": false
}

### down
POST https://cloud.example.com/ocs/v2.php/apps/spreed/api/v1/bot/abcd1234/message
OCS-APIRequest: true
X-Nextcloud-Talk-Bot-Random: <random 32 bytes, hex>
X-Nextcloud-Talk-Bot-Signature: <hex(hmac_sha256(secret, random + message))>
(json)
{
  "message": "**🔴 Payments API is down**\nHTTP 503 (after 3 retries)\n\nTarget: https://pay.example/health\nType: HTTP(S)\nTime: 2026-10-19 14:03:12 UTC\n\n[View monitor](https://vv.example/monitors/7)",
  "silent": false
}

### up
POST https://cloud.example.com/ocs/v2.php/apps/spreed/api/v1/bot/abcd1234/message
OCS-APIRequest: true
X-Nextcloud-Talk-Bot-Random: <random 32 bytes, hex>
X-Nextcloud-Talk-Bot-Signature: <hex(hmac_sha256(secret, random + message))>
(json)
{
  "message": "**🟢 Payments API is back up**\ndown for 12m 4s\n\nTarget: https://pay.example/health\nType: HTTP(S)\nDowntime: 12m 4s\nTime: 2026-10-19 14:03:12 UTC\n\n[View monitor](https://vv.example/monitors/7)",
  "silent": false
}

